# Build context for Dockerfile, Dockerfile.community and Dockerfile.oss (all three use
# ./llm-service). None of them COPYs tests or bytecode, and nothing runs pytest inside the
# image; the tests run from the checkout in CI. Without this file `COPY src/` carried the
# tool-generator test suite and every local __pycache__ into the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
.venv
tests/
src/agents/tool_generator/tests/
# The planner's unit tests sit next to the modules they test; CI runs them from the
# checkout (ci.yml), so the image never needs them.
src/agents/planner/test_*.py
